# Architecture: Hybrid — governance (CP) centralised in the cloud, transfer (DP) local at the edge; the Test Plan's configuration (thesis Table 2.1 / §3.3).
# Only the provider's planes move; the data source (SOURCE_HOST) and the
# consumer (CONSUMER_HOST) stay on their machines in every architecture.
PROVIDER_CP_TIER=cloud
PROVIDER_DP_TIER=edge
